This repository contains code from SGLang (https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang), Apache License 2.0:

- docker/mtpfix/pr37155.diff
  The diff of SGLang pull request #37155 by its author(s)
  (https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/37155), applied unchanged to SGLang v0.5.20.

- docker/embhost/host_embedding_gather.py
  Taken verbatim from SGLang pull request #37826 by its author(s)
  (https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/37826); only the module docstring notes the backport.

- docker/embhost/apply_embed_offload.py
  A backport of the rest of pull request #37826 to SGLang v0.5.20. Modified: the feature is switched on by the
  environment variable SGLANG_OFFLOAD_EMBEDDING_TO_HOST instead of the --offload-embedding-to-host server argument,
  and the edits are applied at image build time by anchored text replacement.

